    "sub_name": "統計學",
    "sub_ename": "STATISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "統計學為統計入門課程，從機率概念由淺入深導引學生進入基本統計概念，了解抽樣分配與估計的演算與運用，主題包括資料整理、機率概念、常用之機率分配、抽樣分配、與點估計。",
    "describe_eh": "Statistics is the first introductory course in which this course starts from the concepts of probability to elementary statistics in order to understand the computation of sampling distribution as well as estimation methods. The topics that include data management, probability concept, some common probability distributions, sampling distribution, and poit estimations.",
